  "kind": "speech",
  "start": 26.867,
  "end": 39.617,
  "speech_start": 27.267,
  "speech_end": 39.217,
  "text": "Pehle baat karte hain daylight photos ki. Din ki roshni mein teeno phones ki photos kaafi achhi aati hain. Colors natural hain aur details bhi theek hain.",
